cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use webular, please cite it with this metadata.
type: software
title: webular
abstract: A web research CLI that sends its judgment calls to Jev, TypeSafe's System One decision model. It scrapes, crawls, maps, extracts, searches, and summarizes with free and open-source parts, as Mastra workflows on Bun with Effect and XState. It runs on your machine, is open source, respects robots.txt by default, and can replay a run with the same result. Jev's key is the only API key, and without it each decision falls back to a rule-based baseline.
authors:
